  "content": "<pre style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/DyM7WJJL/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"670\"><br><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/Jz2HnS9J/TZP-LOGO-2023.png\" alt=\"TZP LOGO\" width=\"1280\" height=\"380\"><br></strong></pre><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>提蘇的殭屍包 - Minecraft（版本 1.7 至 1.20）</strong></span></p><p><strong>提蘇的殭屍包</strong>為 Minecraft 的殭屍帶來了驚人的視覺與聽覺多樣性。</p><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">特色：</span></h3><ul>\n<li><strong>超過 1500 種不同的外觀</strong>：每隻殭屍都獨一無二，為你的遭遇增添多樣性與驚喜。</li>\n<li><strong>數百種全新音效</strong>：多變的呻吟與哀嚎，營造更沉浸且恐怖的氛圍。</li>\n</ul><h3><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">最佳使用方式：</span></h3><p>為充分體驗豐富的殭屍種類，需安裝 <strong>Optifine</strong> 或等效模組。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">相容性：</span></h3><p>提蘇的殭屍包僅修改殭屍、殭屍村民、屍殼與沉屍。你可搭配任何其他資源包使用，只要將其置於資源包列表首位即可。</p><h3><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">最佳夥伴：</span></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/436158188619038730/1245476932305293342/image.png?ex=6658e448&amp;is=665792c8&amp;hm=4a25878b15a53cd1d3ce7045823114cdb40368ad0f64e2c5992457ca888342aa&amp;\" alt=\"Optifine\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/436158188619038730/1245476908854935603/image.png?ex=6658e442&amp;is=665792c2&amp;hm=4f776018f6b8cbacec0058d5b5a4bdaf5ad66e888b099bd411461a0d5c9c3713&amp;\" alt=\"[ETF] Entity Texture Features\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\"></a>&nbsp;<br><br></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/436158188619038730/1245477606829199462/a49a324c9210aaf7f5899199af2eaf6ff345b4ef.webp?ex=6658e4e9&amp;is=66579369&amp;hm=7ff1d28666b2d1866b2cdb0aa4605dc965812da0e257f96ecf6c64a0584892e4&amp;\" alt=\"Fresh Animations\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classic-guns-tac\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/436158188619038730/1245477965656096838/3d15118d02b333b8d8ca5be6a2070ff69d2c0d71.png?ex=6658e53e&amp;is=665793be&amp;hm=9d8210b6f84164f628f5c50b01a8ac1a896b41c66c1dbffa35a1f61625ac9ac7&amp;\" alt=\"Timeless and Classics Guns\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zombie-awareness\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/436158188619038730/1245478607057584138/images.jpg?ex=6658e5d7&amp;is=66579457&amp;hm=cc9c96043d4cdbc80b74310cc67b9321fd61b7c4a03f3730bcd8ad45e92bf109&amp;\" alt=\"Zombie Awareness\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-lost-cities\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/436158188619038730/1245480295252230267/636320465430890063.png?ex=6658e76a&amp;is=665795ea&amp;hm=d0d12b5071eeaa155b7f7e15f6196554f7b96f8aa2cb5b5be400de2940996592&amp;\" alt=\"The Lost Cities\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-sunscreen\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/436158188619038730/1245482592703352853/637756076157485832.png?ex=6658e98e&amp;is=6657980e&amp;hm=66b033de75c7b0ab156e0ef0c7359e0e216de30ca4b924bde1731c1da78c09af&amp;\" alt=\"Download Mob Sunscreen\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\"></a></p><p><br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4YRcJZhSmfo?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><pre style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</pre><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpartners.shockbyte.com%252fa